hadiths[10]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1946","[AI-translation] ´Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : Allah Taala qayamat ke din aasmanon ko lapait le ga aur un ko daahnay haath mein le le ga phir farmaye ga ke mein baadshah hun kahan hain zor walay kahan hain ghuroor walay phir baayein haath se zameen ko lapait le ga (jo daahnay haath ke misl hai aur usi wastay doosri hadees mein hai ke Allah Taala ke donon haath daahnay hain) phir farmaye ga ke mein baadshah hun kahan hain zor walay kahan hain barayi karnay walay "
"1947","[AI-translation] ´Sahl bin Sa'd (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : qayamat ke din log maida ki royi ki tarah safed surkhi maarti hui zameen par ikathay kiye jayein ge us mein kisi ka nishan baaqi na rahay ga (yani koi imaarat jaisay makaan ya meenaar waghera na rahay gi saaf chateel maidaan ho jaye ga) "
"1948","[AI-translation] ´Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se suna Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam farmatay thay ke har aadmi qayamat ke din usi haalat par uthay ga jis haalat par mara tha (yani kufr ya iman par to aitbaar khaatima ka hai aur aakhri waqt ki niyyat ka hai)"
"1949","[AI-translation] ´Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) kehtay hain ke` mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se suna Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam farmatay thay ke jab Allah Taala kisi qaum ko azaab karnay ka irada farmata hai to jo log us qaum mein hotay hain sab ko azaab pahunch jata hai (yani achay aur naik bhi azaab mein shaamil ho jatay hain) phir qayamat ke din apne apne aamaal par uthaye jayein ge (qayamat ke din achay log buron ke saath na hun ge) "
"1950","[AI-translation] ´Aisha (raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke` mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se suna Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam farmatay thay ke qayamat ke din log nangay paon nangay badan aur baghair khatna kiye hue ikathay kiye jayein ge mein ne arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! mard aur aurat aik saath hun ge to aik doosray ko dekhay gein Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke Ae Aisha ! wahan muamla aik doosray ko dekhnay se bohat zyada sakht ho ga (apne apne fikr mein hun ge) "
"1951","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se riwayat kartay hain ke` Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : log teen girohon par ikathay kiye jayein ge (ye wo hashr hai jo qayamat se pehle duniya hi mein ho ga aur ye sab nishaniyon ke baad aakhri nishani hai) baaz khush hun ge aur baaz darrtay hun ge do aik oont par hun ge teen aik oont par hun ge chaar aik oont par hun ge das aik oont par hun ge aur baaqi logon ko aag jama karay gi jab wo raat ko theharein ge to aag bhi thehar jaye gi usi tarah jab dopahar ko soyein ge tab bhi aag thehar jaye gi aur jahan wo subah ko pahunchein ge aag bhi subah karay gi aur jahan wo shaam ko pahunchein ge aag bhi wahein un ke saath shaam karay gi (gharz ke sab logon ko haank kar shaam ke mulk ko le jaye gi) "
"1952","[AI-translation] ´Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` aik aadmi ne kaha ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! kafir ka hashr qayamat ke din munh ke bal kaisay ho ga Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke kiya jis (zaat) ne us ko duniya mein donon paon par chalaya hai wo us baat ki qudrat nahi rakhta ke us ko qayamat ke din munh ke bal chalaye Qatada ne ye hadees sun kar kaha ke beshak Ae hamaray Rab ! to aisi taqat rakhta hai "
"1953","[AI-translation] ´Sulaim bin Amir kehtay hain ke` mujh se Miqdad bin Aswad raziyallahu anhu ne bayan kartay hue kaha ke mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se suna Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam farmatay thay ke qayamat ke din sooraj qareeb kiya jaye ga yahan tak ke aik meel par aa jaye ga Sulaim bin Amir ne kaha ke Allah ki qasam ! mein nahi janta ke meel se kiya muraad hai ye meel zameen ka jo kos ke barabar hota hai ya meel se muraad salaayi hai jis se surma lagatay hain log apne apne aamaal ke muwafiq paseena mein doobe hun ge koi to takhnon tak dooba ho ga koi ghutnon tak koi kamar tak aur kisi ko paseena ki lagaam ho gi aur Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne apne haath se apne munh ki taraf ishara kiya (yani munh tak paseena ho ga) "
"1954","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : beshak qayamat ke din (logon ka) paseena satr baa' (donon haath ki phailayi ke barabar) zameen mein jaye ga aur baaz aadmiyon ke munh ya kaanon tak ho ga (rawi hadees) Saur ko us baat mein shak hai (ke munh tak kaha ya kaanon tak) "
"1955","[AI-translation] ´Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se riwayat kartay hain ke` Allah Taala us shakhs se farmaye ga jis ko jahannam mein sab se halka azaab ho ga ke agar tere paas duniya aur jo kuch us mein hai hota to kiya to us ko de kar apne Aap ko azaab se chhurata wo bolay ga ke haan Allah Taala farmaye ga ke mein ne to us se bohat aasaan baat chaahi thi (jis mein kuch kharch na tha) jab Adam alaihissalam ki pusht mein tha ke tum shirk na karna mein tujhe jahannam mein na le jaun ga to ne na maana aur shirk kiya (maazAllah shirk aisa gunah hai ke wo bakhsha na jaye ga aur shirk karnay wala agar shirk ki haalat mein maray to hamesha hamesha jahannam mein rahay ga) "
